index fa1a2d5..7c13664 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -8,6 +8,15 @@ package, not for somebody reading this repository's commit log.
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Changed
+
+- `ToolRegistry.execute` now validates a tool call's `input` against the tool's declared `inputSchema`
+  (JSON Schema, via `ajv`) before your executor runs. Input that is missing a `required` property or has a
+  property of the wrong type is not passed to the executor; instead `execute` returns a `ToolResponse` whose
+  `result` names the failing property path and constraint, so the model can correct the call on its next
+  tool round. The message never echoes the offending value. If your executor hand-validated its input, it
+  now only ever receives input the schema already accepts.
+
 ## [0.3.0] - 2026-09-17
 
 ### Changed
